@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam defaultFontName Microsoft YaHei
skinparam shadowing false
title UC09 推进物流 序列图
actor 操作员 as U
boundary "物流按钮/HTTP API" as B
control "LogisticsService" as C
database "H2" as DB
U -> B : 校验Advance请求
B -> C : 调用用例操作
C -> DB : 锁记录、校验相邻状态、更新并写轨迹
DB --> C : 结果
C --> B : 提交成功或整体回滚
B --> U : 显示结果或错误
@enduml
